[{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其八 太平之世生民安业皆皇仁所致是以元夕之乐万姓悉感天恩而祝愿万寿也为万寿之诗第八","author":"杨士奇","text":"连城灯火粲繁星，箫鼓声兼祝颂声。\n上祝君王万年寿，年年寰宇乐升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3469,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其九 御苑今岁灯盛前古之所未有光照上下通达四表云霞为之增彩月星为之敛辉然论圣君之明德无远弗照无幽弗烛又至盛极大无以加也为明德之诗第九","author":"杨士奇","text":"翠华高驻广寒宫，万户千门宝炬红。\n瞻仰君王大明德，还如丽日正天中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3470,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其十 皇上仁圣之心惟在与民同乐故载于玺书先后一致今岁灯夕预沐恩荣者自公侯卿大夫下至京城内外介胄之士市廛之夫近而郊坰畎亩之氓远而冰天炎徼之使皆得仰瞻光华心存铭戴为与众同乐之诗第十","author":"杨士奇","text":"西苑华釭千万斛，与民同乐载纶言。\n群臣百姓兼遐裔，瞻仰欢呼戴圣恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3471,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣德庚戌十月廿五日扈从宣府回作","author":"杨士奇","text":"扈从归程闻好语，山妻携得小孙来。\n到家已是风霜老，犹有黄花待我回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3472,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廖子谟县尹像赞","author":"杨士奇","text":"秋水襟怀云锦思，少年先见宰官身。\n寿星正照长沙县，好作阳春为福民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3473,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雨","author":"杨士奇","text":"四畔喧呼寝不宁，萧萧风雨夜三更。\n体寒衣温皆同趣，气叹声嗟共一情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3474,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中戏效竹枝","author":"杨士奇","text":"敕下行营严号令，官军不敢犯秋毫。\n民间尚未知恩旨，关闭柴门个个牢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3475,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出关追忆晃庵 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"公度关山寄我诗，当时羡我免驱驰。\n后来两度关山外，属我驱驰公不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3476,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出关追忆晃庵 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"道义交情金石坚，公归先作月台仙。\n平生知我如公少，一诵遗诗一惘然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3477,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早过土木","author":"杨士奇","text":"四更催起上肩舆，还就民家倒一壶。\n半醉半醒天欲曙，行人霜染白髭须。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3478,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣山 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"崩裂于今未百年，下临流水尚回环。\n行人又动思乡意，为似江西减饭山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3479,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣山 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"山压禅宫泯无迹，空馀遗碣在荒榛。\n梵王不自能防患，何用微言?世人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3480,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泥河书逆旅主人壁","author":"杨士奇","text":"扈从龙舆两度来，天清宣府净浮埃。\n凤阳李福能迎客，下马重过泛酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3481,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思金少保","author":"杨士奇","text":"玉署青坊雨露边，同乡同道更推贤。\n今来独过同行处，泪洒清觞忆往年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3482,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发宣府","author":"杨士奇","text":"跨马乘舆朝复朝，也拚酣醉也拚劳。\n携来绿酒看看减，行过青山步步高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3483,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"附家书示秫","author":"杨士奇","text":"日日承恩侍翠华，老人何事未忘家。\n一缄寄与巢儿说，勤习诗书莫恼爷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3484,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至荨麻林 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"浩荡山川气象开，氛清多倚将臣才。\n平生不解谈孙武，也到荨麻塞上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3485,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至荨麻林 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"渺渺良畴岁岁丰，清山清水澹兼浓。\n世人只说边州苦，不识边州乐趣同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3486,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还至岔道 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"去家不似来家速，半月行边五日还。\n一夜营中喜无寐，銮舆明旦入关山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3487,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还至岔道 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"重九将行酌酒杯，庭中嘉菊半才开。\n于今未及风霜劲，定有黄花待客回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3488,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侄子弼赴吴江训?","author":"杨士奇","text":"春雨琼林秀一枝，南行相赠寄相思。\n岁寒但励冰霜节，白日青天看羽仪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3489,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自题杨园清趣示三子","author":"杨士奇","text":"霜雪云霄空老大，春风玉立翠三竿。\n分枝散叶清如许，谁合他年引凤鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3490,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送尤溪萧知县 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"筼筜新长碧毵毵，四月都门雨正酣。\n写赠尤溪萧茂宰，清风一路向江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3491,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送尤溪萧知县 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"一枝如玉翠亭亭，聊寓同乡赠别情。\n莫向春风爱桃李，冰霜要见岁寒盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3492,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题贞寿堂 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"吾弟身亡三十载，弊庐荒草昼深沉。\n传家赖有诗书泽